{"ref":"BDB, מִיכָה","hw":"מִיכָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִיכָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  Micha, the Ephraimite (𝔊 Μειχαίας), <a data-ref=\"Judges 17:5\" href=\"/Judges.17.5\">Ju 17:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 17:8\" href=\"/Judges.17.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 17:9\" href=\"/Judges.17.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 17:10\" href=\"/Judges.17.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 17:12\" href=\"/Judges.17.12\">12</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 17:13\" href=\"/Judges.17.13\">13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 18:2\" href=\"/Judges.18.2\">18:2 ff.</a> (12 times), called <span dir=\"rtl\">מִיכָֽיְהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 17:1\" href=\"/Judges.17.1\">17:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 17:4\" href=\"/Judges.17.4\">4</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  the prophet Micah (𝔊 Μειχαίας), <a data-ref=\"Micah 1:1\" href=\"/Micah.1.1\">Mi 1:1</a> (<a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 26:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.26.18\">Je 26:18</a> Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">מִיכָיָה</span>).<br><strong>3.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.5\">1 Ch 5:5</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  son of Meribbaal (Mephibosheth) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:34\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.34\">8:34 f.</a> (𝔊 Μιχια), <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:40\" href=\"/Judges.9.40\">9:40 f.</a> (𝔊 Μειχα), called <span dir=\"rtl\">מִיכָא</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 9:12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.9.12\">2 S 9:12</a>.<br><strong>5.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:20\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.20\">23:20</a> (𝔊 Μειχας), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.24\">24:24</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:25\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.25\">25</a> (𝔊 Μειχα).<br><strong>6.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 18:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.18.14\">2 Ch 18:14</a> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">מִיכָֽיְהוּ</span> <strong>2</strong>).<br><strong>7.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:20\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.20\">34:20</a> (‖ <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:12\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.12\">2 K 22:12</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">מִיכָיָה</span>).","next":"BDB, מִיכָא","prev":"BDB, מִיכָיָה"}